# Only what Model-Development/chatbot/Dockerfile copies. Everything else (including .env,
# credentials, data and logs) stays out of the build context.
*
!Model-Development/chatbot/requirements.txt
!Model-Development/chatbot/requirements-serve.txt
!Model-Development/chatbot/answer/
!Model-Development/chatbot/api/
!Model-Development/chatbot/device_search/
!Model-Development/chatbot/query_layer/
!Model-Development/chatbot/query_router/
!Model-Development/chatbot/data/search/
# The approved router, downloaded by query_router.publish --download (MODEL=published)
!Model-Development/chatbot/models/published/
!Web-App/frontend/
Web-App/frontend/node_modules
Web-App/frontend/dist
Web-App/frontend/coverage
Web-App/frontend/.env*
!Web-App/frontend/.env.example
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
